      "description": "Worked as a developer on a best-in-class patient monitoring system.  Notably, I helped write a patient surveillance application to display real-time patient waveform, alert, numeric and demographic information. This included writing an algorithm to collect, buffer, synchronize and display up to 500Hz real-time physiological waveforms while maintaining strict performance goals using rendering optimizations including interops to GDI. This also included a patented layout algorithm in C# and WinForms to dynamically display the most relevant physiological data based on user preference, space available and other factors.",
